			<item>
				<title>Third party</title>
				<link>https://alwaldend.com/docs/third_party/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://alwaldend.com/docs/third_party/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This tree contains vendored and externally sourced code. All tracked content&#xA;follows the repository&amp;rsquo;s public-source policy and retains its upstream license&#xA;and provenance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#requirements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Bazel targets MUST use repository-internal visibility unless an owning&#xA;toolchain contract requires otherwise.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Third-party content MUST NOT be represented or published as first-party&#xA;source or artifacts.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Third-party content MAY be used in builds.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;An explicit repackaging or mirroring target MAY publish an upstream artifact&#xA;under its owner and license policy.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;publish-vendored-helm&#34;&gt;Publish vendored helm&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#publish-vendored-helm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a state-changing operator example. An agent needs explicit publication&#xA;authority and must invoke the target through &lt;code&gt;bazel_agent&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
